<%= docs_render 'page_metadata', title: 'Enums', description: 'Types whose values are restricted to a fixed list of options.' %>

Enumeration types, also called _enums_, are scalar values restricted to a
specific set of allowed values. For more information, see the
[GraphQL enumeration types documentation](https://graphql.org/learn/schema/#enumeration-types).

